\par 1. Yehyira wo, amanaman so Hene,
\par yehyira wo a wonia y[n ani gye.
\par Daa As[m Nyame a wodan 'nipa.
\par Wo d] k[se nti wubehuu y[n mm]b],
\par dom y[n a y[as[e koraa w] y[n b]nem;
\par wo, Yesu, wone y[n guank]bea.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Monto no dwom pa ]soro ne fam ha,
\par momma amanaman ntie ne dom fr[,
